Package: justgivenup
Version: 3.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9)
Maintainer: RaGAEIDOS <noreply+justgivenup@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/RaGAEIDOS/justgivenup
Description: JustGivenUp! Guardian — porn blocker with an irreversible time-lock
 The definitive porn blocker for Chrome, Firefox, Edge and Brave, paired
 with a local dashboard that tracks your recovery streak and motivation.
 .
 * Browser extension (Manifest V3) with declarativeNetRequest rules that
   redirect adult sites to a motivational interstitial.
 * A sealed time-lock (HMAC) that, once set by the user for N days, cannot
   be stopped, shortened or removed — tampering extends it by 90 days.
 * System-wide DNS blocking via /etc/hosts while the lock is active.
 * Enterprise browser policies (URLBlocklist) shipped with the package —
   the block is enforced by the browser policy engine itself.
 * systemd service + watchdog timer: starts at boot, restarts if killed.
 * Web dashboard (Arabic + English): streaks, relapses, ranks, quotes.
 .
 Control flow:  port 8081 (127.0.0.1 only), open http://127.0.0.1:8081
 Extension:     /usr/lib/justgivenup/justgivenup/extension
 Website:       https://github.com/RaGAEIDOS/justgivenup
